    <description>Fires when AF_DiscountApprovalStatus__c changes to Rejected. Notifies the Quote Owner via email and Custom Notification - same dual-channel pattern as AF_FL_Reservation_Rejected. logEmailOnSend+relatedRecordId=$Record.Id added so the email logs as an EmailMessage on the Quote&apos;s own Emails/Activity related list (previously sent but not logged anywhere). 2026-09-09: upgraded from plain text to branded HTML (sendRichBody=true). Tried real EmailTemplate + AF_SendTemplateEmailAction (Apex wrapper around Messaging.sendEmail(templateId=...)) first, since Flow&apos;s own &quot;emailTemplate&quot; core action is confirmed NOT a valid InvocableActionType in this org&apos;s Metadata API - but Messaging.sendEmail to a User target hard-requires saveAsActivity=false, and with that forced false, ZERO EmailMessage row is created (confirmed empirically: isSuccess()=true, no EmailMessage ever appears), unlike emailSimple+logEmailOnSend which reliably logs even to User recipients. Reverted to emailSimple/inline-HTML for this reason - it is the only mechanism proven to both send AND log for a User recipient in this org.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_Subject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Rejected: Quote Discount &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EmailBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;&lt;html&gt;&lt;body style=&quot;margin:0;padding:16px;background-color:#F4F4F6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E2E5EA;border-top:4px solid #B3261E;padding:20px 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FBE4E2;color:#B3261E;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Rejected&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;color:#0B2545;&quot;&gt;Quote Discount Rejected&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;Your discount request on Quote &lt;strong&gt;&apos; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &apos;&lt;/strong&gt; has been rejected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;Please review and resubmit if needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Your discount request on Quote &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &quot; was rejected.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifTitle</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Discount Rejected: &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
